{#- Gold accents from the 2026 poster (7 October, PLAN.md F25): thin gold frame lines and
    laurel branches. Decorative only (aria-hidden), styled in components.css ("Gold accents").
    The section they sit in needs position: relative and a clipped overflow. -#}

{#- Thin gold lines. "full" is a whole tilted rectangle, like the poster's; "corner" is one
    corner with lines that fade out, for page headers. -#}
{%- macro frame(kind="corner", class="") -%}
<span class="gilt-frame gilt-frame--{{ kind }} {{ class }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
{%- endmacro -%}

{#- Two straight gold lines cutting across a section's corners, drawn in the section's own
    proportions (0 to 100 each way). Each place has its own pair, so they read as one frame
    running through the site rather than a repeated sticker. "banner" is the closing banner's
    (from your drawing, 7 October); "soft" in class blurs them a little (committee pages). -#}
{%- macro cuts(kind="banner", class="") -%}
{%- set paths = {
  "banner": "M0 45L25 0M84 0L100 80",
  "letter": "M0 30L16 0M100 64L74 100",
  "schedule": "M0 90L30 100M86 0L100 9",
  "faq": "M0 60L22 0M100 24L88 100",
  "committee": "M0 18L24 0M100 72L70 100"
} -%}
<svg class="gilt-cuts {{ class }}" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="{{ paths[kind] }}"/></svg>
{%- endmacro -%}

{#- A laurel branch, drawn upwards. Its colour is the element's color (currentColor). -#}
{%- macro laurel(class="") -%}
<svg class="laurel {{ class }}" viewBox="0 -12 120 252" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path class="laurel__stem" d="M46 236Q22 128 70 10"/><path d="M41.9 214.3Q37.7 192.5 15.7 189.6Q19.9 211.4 41.9 214.3ZM40.8 206.7Q60.9 197.3 58.4 175.2Q38.3 184.6 40.8 206.7ZM39 188.6Q36.6 168.2 16.5 163.9Q18.8 184.4 39 188.6ZM38.5 180.9Q57.8 173.7 57 153.1Q37.7 160.3 38.5 180.9ZM38 162.7Q37.3 143.7 19 138.3Q19.8 157.3 38 162.7ZM38.1 154.9Q56.3 149.6 57.1 130.6Q38.8 135.9 38.1 154.9ZM39 136.5Q39.6 119 23.3 112.9Q22.7 130.3 39 136.5ZM39.7 128.6Q56.7 125 58.7 107.7Q41.7 111.3 39.7 128.6ZM42 110Q43.7 94.2 29.3 87.6Q27.6 103.3 42 110ZM43.3 102Q59 99.8 61.9 84.3Q46.2 86.4 43.3 102ZM46.9 83.2Q49.5 69.2 37 62.3Q34.4 76.3 46.9 83.2ZM48.8 75.1Q63 74.2 66.7 60.4Q52.4 61.3 48.8 75.1ZM53.9 56.1Q56.9 43.8 46.2 37Q43.2 49.3 53.9 56.1ZM56.3 48Q69 48 73 36Q60.3 36 56.3 48ZM62.8 28.8Q66.1 18.2 57.2 11.7Q53.8 22.3 62.8 28.8ZM65.8 20.6Q76.9 21.3 81.1 11Q70 10.3 65.8 20.6ZM70 10Q80.3 3.4 77.5 -8.5Q67.3 -1.9 70 10Z"/></svg>
{%- endmacro -%}

{#- A small gold sprig with two short lines, like the poster's corner mark. -#}
{%- macro mark(class="") -%}
<span class="gilt-mark {{ class }}" aria-hidden="true">{{ laurel("laurel--sprig") }}<span class="gilt-mark__lines"></span></span>
{%- endmacro -%}
